OL,3,AWoman pleads guilty to breaching
OL,4,Aanonymity order in Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 55-year-old Ballynahinch woman has
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to breaching a lifetime
OL,9,Fanonymity order by posting information
OL,10,Flikely to reveal the alleged identity
OL,11,Fof a victim in the Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,12,Fsex abuse case.
OL,14,FDonna Toman of Lord Moira Park appeared
OL,15,Fat Downpatrick Magistrates' Court on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FA defence lawyer said she was entering
OL,19,Fa guilty plea to a charge relating to a
OL,20,Fsocial media post earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
